#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:16
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (EmailControlCenter), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "Use email settings from System Settings"
msgstr "Nettpostinstellen ut Systeeminstellen bruken"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:17
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (EmailControlCenter), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"Check this box to use the KDE-wide e-mail settings, which are defined using "
"the System Settings \"About Me\" Module. Uncheck this box to be able to "
"specify your full name and e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du de KDE-Instellen för Nettpost bruken wullt. De kannst "
"Du in de Systeeminstellen binnen dat \"Över mi\"-Moduul\"topassen. Wenn Du "
"dit nich anmaakst, kannst Du hier Dien Naam un Nettpostadress ingeven."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:22
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultEmailAttachMethod), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Default Email Attachment Method"
msgstr "Standardmetood för Nettbreefbilagen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:23
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DefaultEmailAttachMethod), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "The default way of attaching dropped emails to an event"
msgstr "De Standardmetood för't Tofögen vun Nettbreven na Begeefnissen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:26
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultEmailAttachMethod), group (Personal Settings)
#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:640
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultTodoAttachMethod), group (Hidden Options)
#: rc.cpp:15 rc.cpp:585
msgid "Always ask"
msgstr "Jümmers nafragen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:29
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultEmailAttachMethod), group (Personal Settings)
#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:643
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultTodoAttachMethod), group (Hidden Options)
#: rc.cpp:18 rc.cpp:588
msgid "Only attach link to message"
msgstr "Bloots Link na de Naricht bileggen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:32
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultEmailAttachMethod), group (Personal Settings)
#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:646
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultTodoAttachMethod), group (Hidden Options)
#: rc.cpp:21 rc.cpp:591
msgid "Attach complete message"
msgstr "Heel Naricht bileggen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:35
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultEmailAttachMethod), group (Personal Settings)
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "Attach message without attachments"
msgstr "Naricht ahn Bilagen bileggen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:45
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Export to HTML with every save"
msgstr "Bi't Sekern jümmers na HTML exporteren"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:46
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"Check this box to export the calendar to a HTML-file every time you save it. "
"By default, this file will be called calendar.html and placed in the user "
"home folder."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du den Kalenner jümmers as en HTML-Datei sekern wullt. "
"Standardwies warrt de Datei \"kalenner.html\" nöömt un steiht binnen Dien "
"Tohuusorner."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:51
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "Enable automatic saving of manually opened calendar files"
msgstr "Per Hand opmaakte Kalenners automaatsch sekern"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:52
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:36
msgid ""
"Check this box to save your calendar file automatically when you exit "
"KOrganizer without asking and periodically, as you work. This setting does "
"not affect the automatic saving of the standard calendar, which is "
"automatically saved after each change."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn KOrganizer Dien Kalennerdatei automaatsch bi't Verlaten un "
"perioodsch bi't Arbeiden sekern schall. Disse Optschoon bedröppt dat Sekern "
"vun den Standardkalenner nich, de warrt na elk Ännern automaatsch sekert."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:57
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "Save &interval in minutes"
msgstr "Se&kerafstand in Minuten"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:58
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:42
msgid ""
"Set the interval between automatic saving of calendar events in minutes "
"here. This setting only applies to files that are opened manually. The "
"standard KDE-wide calendar is automatically saved after each change."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du fastleggen, woveel Tiet twischen twee Sekern vun "
"Kalennerindrääg liggen schall. Disse Optschoon bedröppt bloots Dateien, de "
"Du per Hand opmaakt hest. De Standardkalenner vun KDE warrt automaatsch na "
"elk Ännern sekert."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:64
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Confirm), group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:45
msgid "Confirm deletes"
msgstr "Wegdoon beglöven"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:65
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Confirm), group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:48
msgid "Check this box to display a confirmation dialog when deleting items."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du nochmaal fraagt warrn wullt, ehr Indrääg wegdaan warrt."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:70
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Destination), group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:51
msgid "New Events, To-dos and Journal Entries Should"
msgstr "Niege Begeefnissen, Opgaven un Daagbookindrääg"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:73
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Destination), group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:54
msgid "Be added to the standard calendar"
msgstr "Na den Standardkalenner tofögen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:74
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Destination), group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:57
msgid ""
"Select this option to always record new events, to-dos and journal entries "
"using the standard calendar."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du nieg Begeefnissen, Opgaven un Daagbookindrääg "
"automaatsch binnen den Standardkalenner sekern wullt."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:77
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Destination), group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:60
msgid "Be asked which calendar to use"
msgstr "Na Kalenner fragen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:78
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Destination), group (Save Settings)
#: rc.cpp:63
msgid ""
"Select this option to choose the calendar to be used to record the item each "
"time you create a new event, to-do or journal entry. This choice is "
"recommended if you intend to use the shared folders functionality of the "
"Kolab server or have to manage multiple accounts using Kontact as a KDE "
"Kolab client. "
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, fraagt KOrganizer Di jümmers na den Kalenner, binnen den Du "
"den niegen Indrag wohren wullt, wenn Du en nieg Opgaav, Begeefnis oder "
"Daagbookindrag opstellst. Dit is anraadt, wenn Du de deelten Ornern op den "
"Kolab-Server bruken wullt oder mit Kontact as KDE-Kolab-Client mehr as een "
"Konto plegen muttst. "

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:88
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (System Tray)
#: rc.cpp:66
msgid "Show Reminder Daemon in the System Tray"
msgstr "Anstootdämoon binnen Systeemafsnitt wiesen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:89
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (System Tray)
#: rc.cpp:69
msgid ""
"Check this box to show the KOrganizer reminder daemon in the system tray."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du den KOrganizer-Anstootdämoon binnen den Systeemafsnitt "
"wiesen wullt."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:97
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (TimeZoneId), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:72
msgid ""
"Select your timezone from the list of locations in this drop down box. If "
"your city is not listed, select one which shares the same timezone. "
"KOrganizer will automatically adjust for daylight savings."
msgstr ""
"Söök Dien Oort op de List vun Öörd binnen de Köör ut. Wenn Dien Stadt nich "
"oplist is, söök een binnen Dien Tietrebeet ut. KOrganizer stellt sik "
"automaatsch op Sommer- un Wintertiet in."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:101
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DayBegins), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:75
msgid "Day begins at"
msgstr "Daganfang"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:102
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DayBegins), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Enter the start time for events here. This time should be the earliest time "
"that you use for events, as it will be displayed at the top."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier de fröhste Tiet in, de Du normalerwies för Begeefnissen bruukst, "
"se warrt baven an de Kant wiest."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:107
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Holidays), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:81
msgid "Use holiday region:"
msgstr "Fierdagregioon bruken:"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:108
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Holidays), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Select from which region you want to use the holidays here. Defined holidays "
"are shown as non-working days in the date navigator, the agenda view, etc."
msgstr ""
"Söök de Regioon ut, vun de Du de Fierdaag bruken wullt. Fastleggte Fierdaag "
"warrt binnen de Datumnavigatschoon, de Dagansicht usw. as fre'e Daag wiest."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:112
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (WorkingHoursStart), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:87
msgid "Daily starting hour"
msgstr "Arbeitanfang"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:113
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (WorkingHoursStart), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:90
msgid ""
"Enter the start time for the working hours here. The working hours will be "
"marked with color by KOrganizer."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier Dien Arbeitanfang in. KOrganizer markeert de Arbeitstünnen mit en "
"anner Achtergrundklöör."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:118
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (WorkingHoursEnd), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:93
msgid "Daily ending hour"
msgstr "Arbeitenn"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:119
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (WorkingHoursEnd), group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:96
msgid ""
"Enter the ending time for the working hours here. The working hours will be "
"marked with color by KOrganizer."
msgstr ""
"Giff hier Dien Arbeitenn in. KOrganizer markeert de Arbeitstünnen mit en "
"anner Achtergrundklöör."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:124
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:99
msgid "Exclude holidays"
msgstr "Nich op Fierdaag"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:125
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Time &amp; Date)
#: rc.cpp:102
msgid ""
"Check this box to prevent KOrganizer from marking the working hours on "
"holidays."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn KOrganizer de Arbeitstünnen op Fierdaag nich markeren "
"schall."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:133
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (StartTime), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:105
msgid "Default appointment time"
msgstr "Standardtiet för Terminen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:134
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (StartTime), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:108
msgid ""
"Enter the default time for events here. The default is used if you do not "
"supply a start time."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de Standardtiet för Begeefnissen angeven. Wenn Du keen "
"Anfangtiet angiffst, warrt de Standardtiet nahmen."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:139
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (DefaultDuration), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:111
msgid "Default duration of new appointment (HH:MM)"
msgstr "Standardduer för niege Terminen (hh:mm)"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:140
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (DefaultDuration), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:114
msgid ""
"Enter default duration for events here. The default is used if you do not "
"supply an end time."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du en Standardduer för Begeefnissen fastleggen. Se warrt bruukt, "
"wenn Du keen Enntiet angiffst."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:145
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (defaultEventReminders), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:117
msgid "Enable reminders for new Events"
msgstr "Anstööt för nieg Begeefnissen anmaken"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:146
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (defaultEventReminders), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:120
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to enable reminders for all newly created Events. "
"You can always turn-off the reminders in the Event editor dialog."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du Anstööt för all nieg opstellt Begeefnissen anmaken "
"wullt. Du kannst de Anstööt jümmers binnen den Begeefnis-Bewerkendialoog "
"utmaken."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:147
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (defaultEventReminders), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:123
msgid "By default, enable reminders for new events"
msgstr "Standardwies Anstööt för nieg Begeefnissen anmaken"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:152
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (defaultTodoReminders), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:126
msgid "Enable reminders for new To-dos"
msgstr "Anstööt för nieg Opgaven anmaken"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:153
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (defaultTodoReminders), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:129
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want to enable reminders for all newly created To-dos. "
"You can always turn-off the reminders in the To-do editor dialog."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du Anstööt för all nieg opstellt Opgaven anmaken wullt. Du "
"kannst de Anstööt jümmers binnen den Opgaav-Bewerkendialoog utmaken."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:154
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (defaultTodoReminders), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:132
msgid "By default, enable reminders for new to-dos"
msgstr "Standardwies Anstööt för nieg Opgaven anmaken"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:160
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (ReminderTime), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:135
msgid "Default reminder time"
msgstr "Standardalarmtiet"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:161
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ReminderTime), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:138
msgid ""
"Enter the default reminder time for all newly created items. The time unit "
"is specified in the adjacent combobox."
msgstr ""
"Giff de Standardtiet för Anstööt för all nieg opstellt Indrääg in. De "
"Tieteenheit lett sik in't Utsöökfeld dor blang fastleggen."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:162
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (ReminderTime), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:141
msgid "Default time for reminders"
msgstr "Standardtiet för Anstööt"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:167
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ReminderTimeUnits), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:144
msgid ""
"Enter the default reminder time units for all newly created items. The time "
"is specified in the adjacent spinbox."
msgstr ""
"Giff de Standardtieteenheiten för all nieg opstellt Indrääg in. De Tiet "
"warrt in't Utsöökfeld blangenbi fastleggt."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:168
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (ReminderTimeUnits), group (Default Datetimes)
#: rc.cpp:147
msgid "Default time unit for reminders"
msgstr "Standardtieteenheit för Voranstööt"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:176
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General View)
#: rc.cpp:150
msgid "Enable tooltips for displaying summaries"
msgstr "Tosamenfaten binnen Kortinfos wiesen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:177
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (General View)
#: rc.cpp:153
msgid ""
"Check this box to display summary tooltips when hovering the mouse over an "
"event or a to-do."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du binnen de KortInformatschoon en Tosamenfaten vun dat "
"Begeefnis hebben wullt, op dat Du mit de Muus wiest."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:182
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General View)
#: rc.cpp:156
msgid "To-dos use category colors"
msgstr "Opgaven hebbt Kategorienklören"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:183
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (General View)
#: rc.cpp:159
msgid ""
"Check this box so that to-dos will use category colors and not colors "
"specific to their due, due today or overdue state"
msgstr ""
"Maakt dit an, wenn Du Opgaven mit de Kategorienklören un nich mit Klören för "
"ehr Afloopdatum wiesen wullt"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:188
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General View)
#: rc.cpp:162
msgid "Next x days"
msgstr "Nakamen Daag"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:189
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (General View)
#: rc.cpp:165
msgid ""
"Select the number of \"x\" days to be displayed in the next days view. To "
"access the  the next \"x\" days view, choose the \"Next X Days\" menu item "
"from the \"View\" menu."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wo vele Daag binnen de \"Nakamen Daag\"-Ansicht "
"wiest warrt. Du kannst ehr över \"Nakamen Daag\" binnen dat \"Ansicht\"-Menü "
"opropen."

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:190
#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry, group (General View)
#: rc.cpp:168
msgid "Show this many days at a time in the Next \"x\" days view"
msgstr "Disse Tall vun Daag binnen de \"Nakamen Daag\"-Ansicht wiesen"

#. i18n: file: eventviews.kcfg:195
